      "id": "2073980762882281824",
      "text": "After months of building, rebuilding, coding, fixing bugs, spending money, submitting…\n\nGetting rejected.\n\nFixing.\n\nResubmitting.\n\nGetting rejected again.\n\n(5 rejections later…)\n\nSocial Genius is officially LIVE on the App Store. 🚀🍎\n\nEvery rejection was just another checkpoint. We kept shipping, kept improving, and refused to quit.\n\nNow the real game begins.\n\nTime to bring our marketing sauce, flood the internet with content, and make this thing stupidly viral.\n\nFingers crossed. 🤞",
