      "text": "Spent 5 years building content recommendation engines for 100M+ users at Disney and ESPN. Then I pointed one at the stock market.\n\nTradeWell Research is live on the App Store — AI-ranked stock research, quant scores across 12 sectors and 8 time horizons, and full model transparency. Research only · not financial advice.\n\nIn honor of Norway beating Brazil in the WCup today. Another win for a fellow Norwegian.",
