      "id": "2073946691762548928",
      "text": "AirDrop completely ignores Android users, leaving you stranded when trying to share files between devices. Vianta Connect fixes this ecosystem fragmentation by building a native, secure cross-platform bridge that works entirely over your local Wi-Fi network.\n\nWith this utility, you can drag and drop heavy files wirelessly in seconds, map a universal shared live clipboard, and mirror your mobile notifications directly to your macOS desktop. While the Mac version is fully live on the App Store, the Android companion is clearing Google’s mandatory closed testing phase—DM me your email for instant beta access.\n\n#macOS #AndroidDev #CrossPlatform #BuildInPublic #IndieHackers #TechTrends",
