      "id": "2073362098260767175",
      "text": "my app just went live on the App Store.\nsounds simple.\nit wasn't.\nthe app? built in weeks. Apple's release process? felt like months.\nrejections. resubmissions. waiting. more waiting.\nbut yesterday it happened.\nBetter 0.8.0 - my first iOS release ever.\nhttps://t.co/OI5jn0sCRF",
      "author": {
        "id": "1500742374527729664",
        "name": "Behzod Halil",
