        "text": "Publishing your first iOS app this weekend?\n\n7 reasons to download this CHROME extension for App Store Connect.\n\n1. The Submission Guide has direct links to every field you need to fill out\n2. Smart tips show you what to do next\n3. App Store reviews: Reply in English + auto-translate replies\n4. Auto-localizer: Quickly localize your app into 46+ languages\n5. Dark Mode for App Store Connect (finally!)\n6. Screenshot and App Preview dimensions so you know sizes before you create assets\n7. See your downloads and revenue analytics at a glance\n\nThanks @AscBuddy for sponsoring this post.",
